[28.718245, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[48;5;255m  \u001b[38;5;16mapp/money.py drops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mup (for\u001b[11Gexample,\u001b[20G7% tax \u001b[28Gn 1050\u001b[35Gcents must be 74 cents, not 73). \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btests/t\u001b[11Gst_money.py pins the\u001b[32Grequir\u001b[39Gd behaviour; you can\u001b[61Gun it \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mwith \u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest tests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m. Fix it and tell\u001b[63Gme when\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit i\u001b[8G done. Do not commit; do not push.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the money rounding issue. Let me first check the test to\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bunderstand\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Gexpected\u001b[27Gbehavior,\u001b[37Gthen\u001b[42Glook\u001b[47Gat\u001b[50Gthe\u001b[54Gcurrent\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gimp\u001b[7Gementation.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLet me also check\u001b[21Gthe\u001b[25Gtax\u001b[29Gmodule\u001b[36Gto\u001b[39Gunderstand\u001b[50Gthe\u001b[54Gfull\u001b[59Gcontext:\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I see the\u001b[17Gissue.\u001b[24GThe\u001b[28G\u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[40G\u001b[39mfunction\u001b[49Guses\u001b[54Gfloor\u001b[60Gdivision\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;5;105m//\u001b[39m),\u001b[9Gwhich\u001b[15Gdrops\u001b[21Gfractions.\u001b[32GIt\u001b[35Gneeds\u001b[41Gto\u001b[44Ground\u001b[50Ghalf\u001b[55Gup\u001b[58Ginstead.\u001b[67GFor\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G7350 ÷ 100 = 73.5, it should return 74, not 73.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'll\u001b[8Gfix it using the\u001b[26Gtandard rou\u001b[38Gd-half-up formula:\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;241m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=j806qk;file:///root/nonna-app/app/money.py\u0007app/money.py\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
